      "contentType": "Rich Text",
      "durationMinutes": 75,
      "minimumTimeMinutes": 45,
      "body": "# On-Page SEO, Semantic Markup & Structured Data\n\nOn-page SEO ensures that search engine crawlers and users can clearly interpret the context, topical relevance, and semantic hierarchy of your web pages.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Title Tags & Meta Descriptions\n\n- **Title Tag (`<title>`):** The single most impactful on-page ranking element. Appears as the clickable headline in search engine results.\n  - Length: Keep within **50–60 characters** (approx. 580 pixels) to avoid truncation.\n  - Structure: `Primary Keyword - Secondary Value Proposition | Brand Name`\n  - Example: `Data Engineering Masterclass: Spark & Lakehouse | Nalanda`\n- **Meta Description:** A 150–160 character summary shown beneath the title in search results.\n  - While meta descriptions do not directly affect Google rankings, they directly dictate **Click-Through Rate (CTR)**, which is a major algorithmic engagement signal.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Heading Hierarchy & Content Siloing\n\n```html\n<h1>Complete Guide to Apache Spark Architecture</h1> <!-- Only ONE H1 per page -->\n  <p>Introduction outlining the problem...</p>\n  \n  <h2>1. Spark Master-Worker Execution Topology</h2>\n    <p>Explanation of Driver and Executors...</p>\n    <h3>The Role of the DAGScheduler</h3>\n    <h3>Understanding Executor Task Slots</h3>\n  \n  <h2>2. Catalyst Query Optimizer Explained</h2>\n    <p>Detailed breakdown of logical vs physical plans...</p>\n```\n\n### Internal Linking & Topic Clusters (Hub & Spoke):\n- **Pillar Page (Hub):** A comprehensive 5,000-word overview of a broad topic (e.g., 'Modern Data Architecture').\n- **Cluster Pages (Spokes):** Targeted articles diving into sub-topics (e.g., 'Apache Iceberg Compaction', 'PySpark Memory Management').\n- Every spoke links back to the hub with descriptive keyword anchor text, and the hub links out to spokes, creating a concentrated cluster of topical authority.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Schema.org Structured Data with JSON-LD\n\nStructured data communicates explicit machine-readable context to search engines, unlocking eye-catching **Rich Snippets** (star ratings, FAQ accordions, pricing, and author bios) in Google SERPs:\n\n```html\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Course\",\n  \"name\": \"Data Engineering Masterclass: Spark, Kafka & Lakehouse\",\n  \"description\": \"Comprehensive 32-chapter professional course for distributed systems and cloud lakehouse architecture.\",\n  \"provider\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Nalanda LMS\",\n    \"sameAs\": \"https://www.nalanda.org\"\n  },\n  \"educationalLevel\": \"Advanced\",\n  \"aggregateRating\": {\n    \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n    \"ratingValue\": \"4.9\",\n    \"reviewCount\": \"1420\"\n  },\n  \"offers\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n    \"price\": \"0\",\n    \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n    \"category\": \"Online Training\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n<div class=\"video-container\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; margin: 2rem 0;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5a4G0kZ04rA\" title=\"On-Page SEO & Schema Markup\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n</div>"
